<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech IPB signs 5-yr, 115 mln mark loan.</title>
<headline>Czech IPB signs 5-yr, 115 mln mark loan.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech bank IPB a.s. on Monday said it signed a five-year, 115 million mark syndicated loan from a consortium of banks lead managed by Bayerishce Landesbank.</p>
<p>IPB said in a statement the loan carried a rate of LIBOR plus 30 basis points.  </p>
<p>The statement added that banks from Austria, Switzerland and Germany were involved in the syndicate.</p>
<p>IPB said funds from the loan would be used to help finance its lending activites to domestic clients.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
